# Instance with FD consistency violation
# Two arms with same determining positions (Int, Int) but different determined types (Int vs Float)
[
  # Define a class with FD: (a, b) determines c
  TestAdd: [class [TestAdd a b c] [determines: [[[a b] c]]]
    op: [Fn@c [a b]]]

  # Define instances that violate consistency
  # Both arms have (Int, Int) determining positions but disagree on c
  TestAddInst: [instance TestAdd
    [pattern [a@Int b@Int c@Int]]: [op: [fn [x y] [+ x y]]]
    [pattern [a@Int b@Int c@Float]]: [op: [fn [x y] [+ x y]]]]

  result: 42
]

---

%.result
=== out
consistency violation
